OL,3,GNEWSANoah Donohoe inquest jury finds
OL,4,Aofficials 'erred' over tunnel where he
OL,5,Awas found dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis body was found nearly a week later
OL,8,Fin a tunnel system in north Belfast
OL,10,FA post-mortem examination concluded the
OL,11,Fcause of Noah's death was drowning
OL,13,FThe jury reached a unanimous verdict
OL,14,Fafter five days of deliberations
OL,16,FThe initial deliberations were
OL,17,Fadjourned at the beginning of July to
OL,18,Ffacilitate summer holidays
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
